  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: I saw Brother Hai at the Pho shop earlier. That guy is a machine, always
      working, never complaining.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: "He\u2019s focused, Lan. You should try it sometime instead of watching
      everyone walk by."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: Hey! Watching people is part of the market research! But seriously, I don't
      know where he gets the energy.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Maybe he just doesn't spend his energy talking as much as you do.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 5
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 5
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: Ouch. Low blow, man. But fair point.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
